---
permalink: /_redirects
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
# Canonicalise to the .it primary: the .com alias 301s across (host-matched), so
# the site lives at one domain with no duplicate-content ambiguity. These must
# stay above the path-only rules below, or the /* 404 would catch .com first.
https://robertopianastudio.com/*      https://robertopianastudio.it/:splat  301!
https://www.robertopianastudio.com/*  https://robertopianastudio.it/:splat  301!

# The CMS lives only at /admin. Send the language-prefixed guess there.
# Forced (!) so it wins over the physical fallback page + the /en 404 below.
/en/admin/*  /admin/  301!
/en/admin    /admin/  301!

# Language-aware 404. Existing files take precedence, so these only fire for
# unmatched paths. Specific rule first.
/en/*  /en/404.html  404
/*     /404.html      404
